applications) under the following conditions:
  - Launching Google Chrome and opening GPU-accelerated pages.
  - Playing multiple video streams simultaneously in Chrome (e.g. YouTube).
  - Running Alacritty (GPU-rendered OpenGL terminal) alongside Chrome.
  - Driving the display at 4K (3840x2160) resolution.

